speechtext:
Order, please. I have the honour to inform the House that when the House went up to the Senate chamber, the Deputy Governor General was pleased to give, in Her Majesty's name, the royal assent to the following bills:
Bill C-II, an act relating to the inspection of electric and gas meters and supplies-Chapter No. 87;
Bill C-45, an act to amend the Pest Control Products Act-Chapter No. 88;
Bill C-78, an act to provide for the payment of benefits to laid-off employees and to amend the Canada Labour Code-Chapter No. 89;
Bill C-99, an act for granting to Her Majesty certain sums of money for the Government of Canada for the financial year ending the 31st March, 1982- Chapter No. 90;
Bill C-100, an act for granting to Her Majesty certain sums of money for the Government of Canada for the financial year ending the 31st March, 1983- Chapter No. 91.
